# The EXP-0001 Colab environment (owner decision 2026-10-19): what the run,
# the pilot and their CPU rehearsals install, on every runtime the same.
# scripts/exp0001/lock_colab_environment.sh resolves it into
# requirements.lock (every dependency, by version and hash); the notebooks
# install the lock with uv (uv-version) into a virtual environment of the
# Python in python-version, and `cli env-check` holds the installed
# environment to it. These are the versions the calibration pilot ran with
# (ADR-0008 D4, ADR-0011); the package itself is installed on top, from the
# checkout, without dependencies.
